================================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
================================================================================

This repository is a composite. The MIT grant above does NOT cover every file.
Read this section before redistributing.

1. COVERED BY THE MIT GRANT ABOVE

   - The original adaptation layer authored in this repository:
     `src/`, `scripts/`, `test/`, `manifest.json`, `README.md`, `PACK.md`.

   - The `core` tier: the 18 skills under `skills/` whose `manifest.json` entry
     has `"tier": "core"`, plus `commands/` and `templates/`. These are extracted
     or derived from DevEco Code
     (https://gitcode.com/openharmony-sig/deveco-code), which is MIT licensed at
     every reference this pack was built against (`v0.1.6` and `0.2.0-release`).
     The upstream notice is reproduced in `NOTICE.deveco-code`.

   - The four `harmony-*` skills are derivative works of DevEco Code agent system
     prompts, not verbatim copies. They inherit the upstream MIT terms, and each
     names its source in the first paragraph of its `SKILL.md`.

2. NOT COVERED — REDISTRIBUTE ONLY AFTER YOUR OWN REVIEW

   The `extended` tier: the 39 skills under `skills/` whose `manifest.json` entry
   has `"tier": "extended"`. These come from HarmonyOS Agent Skills
   (https://gitcode.com/HarmonyOS_Skills/harmonyos-agent-skills), pinned at commit
   37f8f380ea9ac840ff1e43dd9a608ab320edffc6.

   That upstream repository ships NO repository-level LICENSE, NOTICE, or COPYING
   file, and its README contains no licensing section. Of the 39 skills included
   here, 9 declare `license: MIT` in their own frontmatter; the remaining 30 carry
   no licence declaration of any kind and are therefore, by default, all rights
   reserved. Absence of a licence is not permission: it does not grant the right
   to copy, redistribute, or create derivative works.

   Per-skill status is recorded in `NOTICE.harmonyos-agent-skills`. The installer
   defaults to `--profile core` and leaves this tier out; `--profile full` opts
   into it and prints a licence warning.

3. THIRD-PARTY FILE HEADERS — PRESERVED, AND THEY GOVERN

   36 files in this repository carry an Apache-2.0 + Huawei copyright header: 26
   from HarmonyOS Agent Skills (`hmos-scan-kit-customscan` 14,
   `hmos-appfreeze-analysis` 10, `hmos-apifault-analysis` 2) and 10 from DevEco
   Code (`arkts-runtime-fix` 9, `deveco-create-project` 1). Those headers are
   reproduced unmodified and take precedence over this file for those files.
   Retain them when redistributing.

4. LOCAL MODIFICATIONS

   Files changed relative to upstream are annotated in place with a `LOCAL PATCH`
   comment and itemised in `provenance/SOURCES.md`.

Full provenance, exclusions, and the reasoning behind each decision:
`provenance/SOURCES.md`, `NOTICE.deveco-code`, `NOTICE.harmonyos-agent-skills`.
